        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 70514PA, Lost Wax Cast Bronze Parma Knob with #14 Oval Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cast Bonze Parma Knob with Oval Rose is sold as a complete set that is easy to install on interior doors needing passage, privacy, or dummy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an available latch for either 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. The Lost Wax Cast Bronze Parma Knob with #14 Oval Rose is is available in either a flat black or medium bronze finishes. This old world knobset is sure to look amazing on any historic home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Parma Door Knob with Oval #14 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Wax Bronze Parma Knobset with Oval Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cast-bronze-finish.jpg?v=1704354518\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
